            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
                <img src="/images/icons/games_opt.png" alt="" class="feature-icon">
                <h2 class="feature-title">Live games</h2>
                <p class="feature-description">Scores, box scores and play-by-play for college and pro matches as they happen, with the rotation on court and a lead chart for each set. On iPhone, keep the score on your lock screen with Live Activities.</p>
                <a href="/game-center" class="feature-link">Follow a match live <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </article>
            <article class="feature-card">
                <img src="/images/icons/statistics_opt.png" alt="" class="feature-icon">
                <h2 class="feature-title">Stats and box scores</h2>
                <p class="feature-description">Nearly 480,000 NCAA player box-score lines since 2023, covering 99.8% of completed Division I matches, and set-by-set player stats for all 445 MLV and LOVB matches. Leaderboards sort by position, conference and class.</p>
                <div class="feature-links">
                    <a href="/ncaa-volleyball" class="feature-link">College volleyball <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
